Patch 0014 -- opt-in fixed-seed value (fr2_xyz gap investigation, 2026-10-02)

util::create_random_engine(use_fixed_seed=true) returns std::mt19937() (seed 5489). With env
STELLA_PORT_SEED=<uint> set it returns std::mt19937(<uint>) instead (still deterministic).
Unset -> byte-identical behaviour. Every RANSAC engine (initializer F/H/E, tracker robust matcher,
relocalizer PnP, loop detector) goes through this one function.

